Subject: [PATCH] feat: add inventory drag-and-drop for runes and fix Folia
 compatibility

- Change EnchantmentRune and SoulboundRune to use runSyncAtLocation
  instead of runSyncAtEntity to fix cross-region entity access on Folia
- Create RuneInteractionListener to allow applying runes via inventory
  click-and-drag (cursor rune clicked onto target item)
- Register RuneInteractionListener in Slimefun#registerListeners
